# Set these as Worker secrets, NOT plain vars:
#   wrangler secret put AUTH_SECRET
#   wrangler secret put DISCORD_CLIENT_ID
#   wrangler secret put DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
#
# Discord app: https://discord.com/developers/applications
# OAuth2 Redirect URI (production): https://<your-worker>.workers.dev/api/auth/discord/callback
# OAuth2 Redirect URI (dev):        http://localhost:8787/api/auth/discord/callback
#
# AUTH_SECRET: generate with `openssl rand -base64 32`.
# Also signs MCP API tokens — do not rotate after deploy, existing tokens break.
#
# ALLOWED_ORIGIN is a plain var (not secret) — set in wrangler.jsonc "vars",
# must match the Pages frontend origin exactly (no trailing slash).
